07)------------HashJoinExec: mode=CollectLeft, join_type=Inner, on=[(r_reason_sk@0, wr_reason_sk@1)], projection=[ws_quantity@2, wr_fee@4, wr_refunded_cash@5, r_reason_desc@1]
08)--------------DataSourceExec: file_groups={1 group: [[${WORK_DIR}/reason.vortex]]}, projection=[r_reason_sk, r_reason_desc], file_type=vortex
